{"4358580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Things We Lost", "steam_appid": 4358580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror seen through the eyes of a man confined to a wheelchair after a recent car accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shortly before the crash, he inherited the house where he grew up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you remain inside, the stronger the unease becomes, slowly settling in your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality begins to fracture — and it is no longer certain that you are the only one who truly lives in the house.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror seen through the eyes of a man confined to a wheelchair after a recent car accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shortly before the crash, he inherited the house where he grew up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you remain inside, the stronger the unease becomes, slowly settling in your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality begins to fracture — and it is no longer certain that you are the only one who truly lives in the house.</p>", "short_description": "A slow-paced psychological horror centered on atmosphere and vulnerability. Bound to a wheelchair, you explore an old house under constant mental pressure. There is no combat - only observation, tension, and a decision that can change the story’s direction.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358580/6fa85162fba5ad5ef91ef9bfb9ed36309d6b7d0f/header.jpg?t=1786725006", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358580/273adfc77a55eda2e519ba6a51d20ce5f640fd28/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786725006", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps